/S /P
/P 531 0 R
/E (The Regime Shift: The "Cheap Money" \(ZIRP\) era is officially dead. We have transitioned into a "New Neutral" where interest rates and yields sustain above 3%, creating a high-conviction environment where only fundamentally strong assets survive.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 532 0 R
/E (Liquidity Divergence: There is a massive split between institutional and on-chain behavior. While institutional players are de-risking \(cutting long positions on the CME\), the on-chain Stablecoin Market Cap has hit a historic $300B+, representing a massive reservoir of "dry powder" waiting for a catalyst.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 533 0 R
/E (Macro Headwinds: Global liquidity \(M2\) has stalled, and while inflation is cooling toward the 2% target, Consumer Stress is rising. High credit card delinquencies and a softening labor market \(lower JOLTS\) are pressuring the Fed to pivot toward rate cuts to avoid a recession.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 534 0 R
/E (Selective Performance: The market is no longer a "rising tide lifts all boats" scenario. Bitcoin and Ethereum have faced early-year drawdowns, while isolated narratives \(like HYPE\) are seeing explosive gains, indicating that capital is becoming extremely selective.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
