/T (1. Why did the crypto market experience significant drawdowns at the start of 2026? Despite a massive structural expansion in 2025, early 2026 saw Bitcoin and Ethereum face double-digit drawdowns \(reaching -14.8% and -19.6% respectively in February\) due to a combination of stalled global M2 liquidity and institutional de-risking. While specific outliers like HYPE \(+32.54%\) decoupled from the trend, the broader market was suppressed by a "wait-and-see" approach as the Federal Reserve struggled to balance cooling inflation against rising consumer financial stress.)
/E (1. Why did the crypto market experience significant drawdowns at the start of 2026? Despite a massive structural expansion in 2025, early 2026 saw Bitcoin and Ethereum face double-digit drawdowns \(reaching -14.8% and -19.6% respectively in February\) due to a combination of stalled global M2 liquidity and institutional de-risking. While specific outliers like HYPE \(+32.54%\) decoupled from the trend, the broader market was suppressed by a "wait-and-see" approach as the Federal Reserve struggled to balance cooling inflation against rising consumer financial stress.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
