/Title (2. Is the era of "Cheap Money" \(ZIRP\) officially over for the crypto markets? Yes. The data confirms a definitive Macro Regime Shift, signaling the "Death of ZIRP" \(Zero Interest Rate Policy\). We have entered a "New Neutral Reality" where interest rates and 10-year yields are stabilizing above the 3.0% threshold. This means the "easy liquidity" environment of 2020-2021 has been replaced by a higher structural cost of capital, requiring investors to focus more on fundamental utility rather than pure speculative momentum.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 697 0 R
/Prev 834 0 R
/Next 920 0 R
>>
endobj
910 0 obj
<<
/Title (4. How is the labor market cooling affecting Federal Reserve policy? Leading indicators such as JOLTS job openings are in a sustained downtrend, and the unemployment rate is gradually edging higher. Combined with credit card delinquency rates hitting cyclical highs, there is clear evidence of "Consumer Stress." This cooling labor market acts as a primary catalyst for the Fed to pivot toward rate cuts to prevent a deeper recession, even as they attempt to avoid a "Stagflation Trap.")
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 697 0 R
/Prev 920 0 R
/Next 835 0 R
>>
endobj
