/Title (The "DAT Inflows by Asset" chart showcases a paradigm shift in capital allocation, where historical inflow levels from 2020-2024 were eclipsed by massive institutional-grade surges throughout 2025 and into early 2026. While Bitcoin and Ethereum dominate the lion's share of this capital intake, recent data highlights a diversifying inflow profile featuring assets like XRP, Solana, and Story, indicating that despite broader macro volatility, structural "buy-side" demand remains significantly higher than in any previous cycle.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 832 0 R
/Prev 924 0 R
/Next 907 0 R
>>
endobj
920 0 obj
