/Title (3. What does the $300B+ Stablecoin Market Cap signify for future market movements? While we recently observed a temporary $4 billion contraction in USDT/USDC supply, the total Stablecoin Market Cap reaching a historic $300 billion milestone indicates a massive amount of "dry powder" remains on-chain. This suggests that while institutional investors are de-risking their directional futures positions \(as seen in CME data\), the underlying liquidity base is stronger than in any previous cycle, providing a high-conviction floor for potential capital redeployment.)
